  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Mars for the Rich** (1 other source): Track fourteen contained elements of the new song Iron Lung [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Blame It on the Weather**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Sea of Trees**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Hot Wax**: back after 30 archived shows (1408 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **KGLW2022-04-28** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 107 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **kglw2022-04-28.ak50**: source not stated; 15 songs; 106 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **KGLW2022-04-28**: taped by Ted Mattes; transferred by Joe Noel; source: Schoeps MK4 cardioids > N Box Platinum > Tascam Dr-2d (WAV16/48) [1]. Also: Edited and mastered by Joe Noel in Adobe Audition [1]\n- **kglw2022-04-28.ak50**: taped by captainentropy; transferred by captainentropy; source: Neumann AK 50 > nBob actives > Naiant IPA > Sound Devices MixPre-3 II (32/96), FOB (room center), mics PAS, 7 ft [2]. Also: Stu Mackenzie played vocals, guitars, and flute; Ambrose Kenny-Smith handled vocals, harmonicas, keyboards, and percussion; Joey Walker played guitars, vocals, bass guitar, keyboards, and percussion [2]",
